From 1e16f085799bbfb701d997a7ca94ac556121284e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hiper25 <whydonit@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:08:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/meson: Select automatic AFBC frame resets on SC2

SC2 no longer uses the G12A per-frame software-reset workaround,
but still inherits its manual-reset bit. The first-frame observation
keeps AFBC active through the first UHD frame, then observes its error
state around the following VSYNC with the same header.

Select automatic frame resets on SC2 during AFBCD initialization,
after VIU initialization disables OSD and AFBC routing and before
CRTC creation and IRQ registration. Retain G12A manual mode, the SC2
activation reset, RDMA operation and existing buffer ownership.

This is a startup-configured hardware candidate. Do not reproduce the
unsafe live manual-bit restoration experiment; actual mode and UI
acceptance must establish the result after a normal image restart.

Change-Id: Ib3a861f85927e19b6efb8ea8fcb597c17ed25d43
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_osd_afbcd.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_osd_afbcd.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_osd_afbcd.c
index 15fdc5e2f9a6..5c18fecebce3 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_osd_afbcd.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/meson/meson_osd_afbcd.c
@@ -305,8 +305,9 @@ static int meson_g12a_afbcd_init(struct meson_drm *priv)
 
 	meson_rdma_setup(priv);
 
-	/* Handle AFBC Decoder reset manually */
-	writel_bits_relaxed(MALI_AFBCD_MANUAL_RESET, MALI_AFBCD_MANUAL_RESET,
+	/* Use frame-boundary resets on SC2; retain G12A's manual workaround. */
+	writel_bits_relaxed(MALI_AFBCD_MANUAL_RESET,
+			    priv->sc2 ? 0 : MALI_AFBCD_MANUAL_RESET,
 			    priv->io_base + _REG(MALI_AFBCD_TOP_CTRL));
 
 	return 0;
